  9. Package baseline: what is always installed (`base` dev tools, firmware, core tools) and what remains optional.
  10. AUR policy: whether to use `paru`, how to install it, and which build user to use.
  11. Default systemd services: which units are always enabled at install time.
  12. Base security policy: firewall, SSH (if applicable), sudo policy.
  13. Real session/login strategy: initial display manager and fallback until custom implementation exists.
  14. Nvidia driver: ask about the nvidia driver to install (nouveau, nvidia, nvidia-open or none) in a 1..4 selector with a hint about the GPU model
  15. Dotfiles loader: sync symlinks with $home template variables, package lists (pacman and AUR) and sync scripts